A comment line below a nested line block's column stays in its span

```
- - ::: |
    %%%
%%%%
    %%%
z
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <div class="line-block">

        </div>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ul>
<p>z</p>
```

```
- x
  - ::: |
    %%%
%% c
    %%%
z
.
<ul>
  <li>x
    <ul>
      <li>
        <div class="line-block">

        </div>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ul>
<p>z</p>
```

```
- - ::: |
    %%%
   %%%%
    %%%
    b
z
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <div class="line-block">
          <p>b<br>
z</p>
        </div>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ul>
```

